    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d716">

                <pb facs="0762" n="748" sameAs="frus:frus1944v07/pg748"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">825.24/1875a: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in Chile</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Bowers</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1944-06-22">June 22, 1944</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>726. Reference Embassy’s no. 1067 of June 19.<anchor n="67" xml:id="d716-f1"/>
                    Announcement of decentralization rollback for Chile was made in Current Export
                    Bulletin no. 172 of June 17. Chile’s concurrence was not received in time to be
                    included in announcement of June 15 for other countries.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
